'' -x IS IGNORED WITH -c, as fbc ignores it: 'fbc -c a.bas -x zz.o' writes a.o. Here -o names
'' the object, and -x writes nothing.
'' TEST: cli
'' CLEAN: build/.xoc
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -c tests/driver/src/build-run.tiko -o build/.xoc/obj.o -x build/.xoc/x.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: build/.xoc/obj.o
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: build/.xoc/x.o
